{
  "slug": "neko-harness-doctor",
  "name": "Neko Harness Doctor",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Diagnose your Claude Code harness (CLAUDE.md, settings.json, .mcp.json, hooks, skills, memory, MCP servers, and workflow) against 25 anti-pattern indicators. Outputs an S–E overall grade, per-category scores, violations with evidence citations, and prioritized Quick Wins. Includes an interactive fix flow: `--fix-mode propose` emits structured JSON proposals that Claude Code applies via the Edit tool with per-item user approval. Deterministic (no LLM — grep/AST/JSON only), zero runtime dependencies, bilingual (Japanese default, English via `--lang en`). When installed as a plugin, the bundled skill auto-triggers on natural-language requests like \"diagnose my harness\" and exposes `/neko-harness-doctor` as a slash command.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `neko-harness-doctor` (Diagnose Claude Code harness (CLAUDE.md, settings.json, .mcp.json, hooks, skills, memory, MCP, workflow) against 25 anti-pattern indicators).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install neko-harness-doctor@claude-community` from `aliksir/neko-harness-doctor`.\n\nAutomatically diagnoses your Claude Code environment (`CLAUDE.md` / `settings.json` / `.mcp.json` / `hooks/` / `skills/` / `memory/` / `MCP` / `workflow`) against 25 anti-pattern indicators, outputting an S-to-E grade and prioritized Quick Wins (improvement suggestions).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
